# In a file without written types the front end draws "a list of numbers" from `p.length` and `0.5 * p[i]`. Bytes and views answer that use as a list does, and nobody wrote the word: where the value stands
# in front of the loop (ways meet, a call answers) the loop asked for a list alone, a view failed it at every entry, and every turn ran closed: 128 instructions an element. The front asks for the list and,
# beside it, for every view of numbers, read by the kind of its cell: one copy more.
